# Example environment for the frontend. Copy to `.env` (gitignored, personal).
# NEVER commit a real backend URL — keep it local or in the host's dashboard.
#
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-backend.onrender.com
#   * Optional. If unset, local dev uses the Vite proxy (/api -> localhost:8000).
#   * For production (Vercel), set this in the Vercel dashboard's
#     Environment Variables instead of committing it.
